# Expo Router screens

- One route per file in `src/app/`; default export should re-export a feature `*Page` from `@/features/`.
- Use `_layout.tsx` for app shell (providers, tabs, `PortalHost`).
- Import `Link`, `router`, and `useLocalSearchParams` from `expo-router`.
- No feature UI or data fetching in route files — only re-exports and layouts.
- Use `router.push` / `router.replace` for imperative navigation; `Link` for tappable navigation.
- Do not add non-route modules under `src/app/` — they become accidental routes.
